-vertx-web app listening on port 8080 (default). This was tried in JVM and Native modes.\r\n3. Try to stop the quarkus-vertx-web app via SIGTERM.\r\n\r\n**Environment (please complete the following information):**\r\n - Output of `uname -a` or `ver`: \r\n```\r\nLinux <host-redacted> 5.0.16-200.fc29.x86_64 #1 SMP Tue May 14 18:27:35 UTC 2019 x86_64 x86_64 x86_64 GNU/Linux\r\n```\r\n - GraalVM version (if different from Java): \r\n```\r\ngraalvm-ce-1.0.0-rc16\r\n```\r\n - Quarkus version or git rev: \r\n```\r\n<dependency>\r\n    <groupId>io.quarkus</groupId>\r\n    <artifactId>quarkus-vertx-web</artifactId>\r\n    <version>0.15.0</version>\r\n</dependency>\r\n\r\n```\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"kenfinnigan","id":441240,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MTI0MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/441240?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenfinnigan","html_url":"https://github.com/kenfinnigan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenfinnigan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenfinnigan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenfinnigan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenfinnigan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenfinnigan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenfinnigan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenfinnigan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenfinnigan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenfinnigan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/2544/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/2544/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}